    "diagnosis": "Breast carcinoma metastatic to olfactory neuroblastoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Tumour-to-tumour metastasis often develops as part of a sanctuary site or altered vascularity. Metastatic lobular breast carcinoma is seen here, intermingled with an olfactory neuroblastoma.",
